# Vue bridge, Nuxt plugins, shims

Maps: `src/runtime/vue/README.md`, `src/runtime/vue/stubs/README.md`, `src/runtime/plugins/README.md`, `src/shims/README.md`.

- `plugin.ts` `install` applies `ui` overrides. Vite `ui({ ui })` does not replace `app.use`. Color variables come from the generated stylesheet, not from this install.
- `#imports` exposes only `useAppConfig` today. Keep its signature aligned across:
  - `src/shims/imports.ts` (typecheck, no behavior)
  - `src/runtime/vue/stubs/imports.ts` (Vite runtime, plus `applyUiOverrides`)
  - `test/mocks/imports.ts` (Vitest)
- A runtime file that starts importing another Nuxt auto-import (`useHead`, `defineNuxtPlugin`, ...) must add it to all three in the same change.
- Shims must not touch the DOM. A Vue stub that touches `document` must no-op when it is missing (SSR).
